1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,110
If you ever get a text message

2
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:03,690
from your own number

3
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:06,540
at three seventeen in the morning…

4
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:08,755
do exactly what it says.

5
00:00:09,330 --> 00:00:10,300
Last night,

6
00:00:10,350 --> 00:00:11,800
my phone lit up.

7
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:13,610
Three seventeen a.m.

8
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:15,030
The sender…

9
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:16,260
was me.

10
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:17,620
One message:

11
00:00:17,670 --> 00:00:19,375
“Don't go downstairs.”

12
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:21,270
I thought it was a glitch.

13
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,610
Maybe a prank.

14
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:24,270
I almost went back to sleep.

15
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:26,520
And I heard something.

16
00:00:26,570 --> 00:00:27,670
Fridge door.

17
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:28,930
Downstairs.

18
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:30,090
Opening…

19
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:31,375
and closing.

20
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:33,720
My phone buzzed again:

21
00:00:33,770 --> 00:00:34,840
“It's in the kitchen.

22
00:00:34,890 --> 00:00:36,400
Stay in bed.”

23
00:00:36,450 --> 00:00:37,930
Another message:

24
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:38,540
“Don't answer

25
00:00:38,590 --> 00:00:40,020
when Mom calls you.”

26
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:41,590
And right then…

27
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:43,310
from the bottom of the stairs…

28
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:45,340
I heard my mom's voice.

29
00:00:45,390 --> 00:00:46,040
“Honey?

30
00:00:46,090 --> 00:00:47,435
Come down here a second.”

31
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:48,850
I swear,

32
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:50,130
I almost went.

33
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:51,210
My foot was already

34
00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:52,160
on the floor.

35
00:00:52,470 --> 00:00:53,260
Then my phone buzzed

36
00:00:53,310 --> 00:00:54,660
one last time.

37
00:00:54,710 --> 00:00:55,500
This time…

38
00:00:55,550 --> 00:00:57,040
the message wasn't from me.

39
00:00:57,090 --> 00:00:58,210
It was from Mom.

40
00:00:58,560 --> 00:00:59,700
“Are you awake?

41
00:00:59,750 --> 00:01:00,960
Don't make a sound.

42
00:01:01,010 --> 00:01:02,400
I'm hiding in my closet.

43
00:01:02,450 --> 00:01:03,995
Someone's in the kitchen.”

44
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:05,590
I froze.

45
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:06,740
I didn't move.

46
00:01:06,790 --> 00:01:08,310
I didn't even breathe.

47
00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:09,380
I stayed in that bed

48
00:01:09,430 --> 00:01:10,780
until sunrise.

49
00:01:11,170 --> 00:01:13,180
When I finally went downstairs,

50
00:01:13,230 --> 00:01:14,940
the kitchen was empty.

51
00:01:14,990 --> 00:01:16,100
Every cabinet…

52
00:01:16,150 --> 00:01:17,420
wide open.

53
00:01:17,470 --> 00:01:18,600
Every chair…

54
00:01:18,650 --> 00:01:20,735
turned to face the stairs.

55
00:01:21,310 --> 00:01:22,020
I still don't know

56
00:01:22,070 --> 00:01:23,790
who sent those first messages.

57
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:24,955
But I know one thing.

58
00:01:25,310 --> 00:01:26,910
Whatever was in that kitchen

59
00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:29,390
can copy any voice it hears.

60
00:01:29,440 --> 00:01:31,015
It just can't text.

61
00:01:31,520 --> 00:01:32,430
So if you hear someone

62
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:33,920
calling your name tonight…

63
00:01:33,970 --> 00:01:34,890
don't answer.

64
00:01:34,940 --> 00:01:36,315
Check your phone first.

65
00:01:36,570 --> 00:01:37,230
You might be getting

66
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:38,130
a warning…

67
00:01:38,180 --> 00:01:38,980
from someone who's

68
00:01:39,030 --> 00:01:41,445
already seen what's downstairs.

69
00:01:41,970 --> 00:01:42,720
Send this to someone

70
00:01:42,770 --> 00:01:43,780
who sleeps with their phone

71
00:01:43,830 --> 00:01:44,910
next to their bed.

72
00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:48,121
And follow for part two.
